{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a relentless survival scenario: In <strong>BPROOF</strong>, you fight alone or cooperatively with up to 3 friends in wave-based combat against swarms of unforgiving enemies \u2014 or face high-pressure escape scenarios where you're hunted while solving life-or-death puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the atmosphere</strong>: From abandoned Western towns to alien planets and post-apocalyptic wastelands \u2014 each location delivers eerie, unsettling environments filled with tension and adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your arsenal, customize enemies and modes \u2014 whether it's brutal survival waves or intense escape missions. Eliminate supernatural foes to earn points, unlock new maps through the shop, and lead your crew through the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror &amp; Survival Elements</strong><br>Gruesome environments, zombie-like enemies, and a dark tone deliver an intense survival-horror vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Customizable Matches</strong><br>Choose enemy types, enemy count, weapon loadouts, and map settings to shape your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Mode</strong><br>In selected maps, you'll be hunted \u2014 solve puzzles and escape under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong><br>Online mode for up to 4 players \u2013 survive together, or die trying.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Match ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/cd0444234e148ed573fab012a742fbe28800c263.jpg"},{"name":"Killed the First 50s","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3838660/41256a1e0622c027159ffe65adc5ed9b2a676246.